  "name": "Baked Coconut Dhal with Spiced Cauliflower and Paneer",
  "subtitle": "A creamy lentil bake with roasted vegetables and paneer",
  "description": "Red lentils and chana dhal bake with coconut milk, tomatoes, aromatics, and spices, then finish with cauliflower, paneer, lemon, chilli, and coriander.",
